RP2350 application completed

The numeric pin and lease contract line covers invalid frequency and maximum
frequency values, GP0 PSRAM-CS restriction, negative encoded gpio.Pin rejection,
out-of-range GPIO rejection, GPIO pool conflict, cross-generator slice conflict,
same-channel alias conflict (GP6/GP22), failed-start rollback, channel close and
group close ownership release.

Development note: versions 17 and 21 exposed a test-time primitive abort before
waveform measurement: `fatal: Throwing new not allowed: 16`.  The final fix
removed two std::function-backed Defer guards from pwm.start and used explicit
failure cleanup.  The version-23 PWM object has no undefined plain throwing-new
symbol (`_Znwj`); its resource allocations use nothrow new.
